	"Description": "✦ [b]You need both AT and DGA for this mod to work[/b]\n<br />\n<br />✦ This mod adds 8 beds to your game through dynamic game assets (DGA): the Classic Oak double and single beds, the Classic Birch double and single beds, the Classic Walnut double and single beds and lastly the Classic Mahogany double and single beds.\n<br />\n<br />✦\u00A0You can pick the blanket you want with the alternative textures (AT) paint bucket\n<br />\n<br />✦ The beds are sold at Robin's shop on Monday, Wednesday, Thursday and Friday\n<br />\n<br />✦ I love having\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6367]Vibrant Pastoral Recolor[/url]\uFEFF in my game, so I made the woods of the bed frames match with VPR’s wooden furniture.\n<br />\n<br />✦ There is also 2 optional additions in the zip file; the Classic Plum Mahogany double and single beds and the Classic Light Birch double and single beds. These were made to match with\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/15446]my mahogany and birch furniture recolor[/url].",
